{"id":"n71254-1-3","stage":0,"title":"아직 · 尚未","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71254-1-3-1","ko":"책장 정리는 다 했니?","zh":"书架整理完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책장","meaning":"书柜","explanation":"책장：书柜","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78697","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}},{"text":"정리는","meaning":"整理，收拾，清理","explanation":"정리：整理，收拾，清理；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"정리","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75781","senseId":"1","lemma":"정리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정리는","audio":"/audio/1e066e149ff35182b5bc.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"했니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했니","audio":"/audio/1889ab3866856ff3fbae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0aedd7a678ca8a1d","term":"책장","zh":"书柜","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3","entryId":"78697","definition":"存放书籍的柜子。","pronunciation":["책짱"]},{"id":"829a277fc72022a6","term":"정리","zh":"整理，收拾，清理","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3","entryId":"75781","definition":"将处于散乱状态的东西归整到一起或扔掉。","pronunciation":["정ː니"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f8d81f7c9da7c7a80988.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71254-1-3-2","ko":"아니요, 아직 다 못 했어요. 조금만 더 기다려 주세요.","zh":"还没，还没全部弄完。请再稍等一会儿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어요","audio":"/audio/767a8404e5a0794daaf5.mp3"}},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entr